  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d95f71226bf26bc4caed6a0458a3b538, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lesson 10 Question 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: Since God is sovereign over all events, is He also sovereign over your
    salvation?
  answers:
  - My own goodness will save me
  - Absolutely
  - No way!
  - God did some, and I did some
  correctAnswerIndex: 1
  discussionAnswer: God alone determines for each person whether they will be saved.
    God controls how and when you hear the gospel, and whether you're elect so that
    the Holy Spirit applies the life and death of Jesus to you, so that you're born
    again and repent of sin, to receive faith in Christ.
